# The image build copies a handful of paths (docker/backend.Dockerfile); everything else stays out of the context,
# above all secrets and the multi-hundred-megabyte local environments.
**
!backend/pyproject.toml
!backend/uv.lock
!backend/README.md
!backend/src/**
!backend/alembic.ini
!backend/migrations/**
!docker/prefetch.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
